U7iaRTcIyTbH.jpg\",\"rating\":3,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":94803,\"title\":\"Jetelín\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fuN3n8fOcTlNqAa5nGdwK1i3Ase.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Their marriage in tatters, Sean sleeps with a cast member and Bev dates Morning's brother; Carol continues to see Merc; Matt has an affair with Merc's wife, Jamie; everyone deals with Pucks' poor ratings in their own unique ways.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/osnf1kVUII42Q7p1kKviEf3IoWF.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2012-05-11\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 201\",\"overview\":\"Sean and Beverly's marriage has been ripped apart by Beverly's fling with Matt. And Matt's friendship with Sean appears to be beyond salvage. But as their sitcom \\\"Pucks!\\\" premieres in the U.S., the three are forced to find a way to continue working together.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kwmEUnXRbzQ9sr6MxX1ZqMEHFAa.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":13,\"airDate\":\"2012-05-11\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 202\",\"overview\":\"Matt misses his \\\"bromance\\\" with Sean and tries to rekindle their friendship by buying him the sports car of his dreams. But Sean is not willing to forgive or forget that easily.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2T9oP2XJaQQj3CrAVgEHEht0eyB.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"voteCount\":13,\"airDate\":\"2012-05-18\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 203\",\"overview\":\"When network head Merc Lapidus's father dies, Sean and Beverly get a lesson in grief, Hollywood-style.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aKpUFIW0ukRwoqPNrdPN7Ky96Bo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":12,\"airDate\":\"2012-05-25\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 204\",\"overview\":\"The ratings for \\\"Pucks!\\\" are plummeting. The network asks Sean and Beverly to reduce Matt's role in the show to make way for his teenage co-stars - the increasingly popular \\\"Pucks!\\\" boys. This enrages Matt, who gets drunk and is ready to take some rash actions, but Beverly asks him to reconsider.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vdXkfM1mlyPRDIalQQANxlucke1.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"voteCount\":14,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-01\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 205\",\"overview\":\"Sean meets Labia, a super-fan of Matt's and Morning suffers a major plastic surgery disaster. Meanwhile, Merc and Carol plan a weekend getaway to Mexico, while Jamie and Matt pack for a tryst in Napa.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AdELcnk1ZNMOYVPQNa3hL6e7idf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":11,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-08\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 206\",\"overview\":\"To boost flagging ratings, Merc asks Matt to get one of his former 'Friends' cast mates to make a special guest appearance on 'Pucks!'. Not above asking favours of his own, Matt asks Sean and Beverly to write his speech for Merc's upcoming Man of the Year event.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cvlKrPcex6N3fdb05Bp0wA4YtpE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"voteCount\":13,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-15\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 207\",\"overview\":\"The network insists that Sean and Beverly confront Matt about his recent weight gain. The star does not take the news well. Meanwhile, Beverly agrees to go out to dinner with Morning's brother Rob, even though she insists that she is terrible at dating. She is not wrong, and she turns the evening into a date from hell.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9tdYJZJ6xgt9GVzExmmXNin49Ny.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":13,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-22\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 208\",\"overview\":\"Matt's life continues to fall apart when he falls foul of his fierce ex-wife. Beverly prepares to go on a second date with Morning's brother Rob, but things have become much more complicated now that Sean is aware that she is seeing someone.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g3liPB5aGzp2zz1RMplWq0Pozsm.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":11,\"airDate\":\"2012-06-29\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 209\",\"overview\":\"It's the night of Merc's 'Man of the Year' event. However, his moment of glory turns sour when Carol tells him about Matt's affair with Jamie. Beverly's relationship with Rob grows deeper, and Sean is forced to decide whether he's willing to forget the past and fight for his wife.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4cLbPEMShY7A0caYnXW3qVeyLIE.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":10,\"airDate\":\"2012-07-06\",\"runtime\":30}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2011-01-09\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}